on&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;tooltip-hover sense-tooltip&quot; href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/free-rules/rules-glossary#Darkvision&quot; data-tooltip-href=&quot;//www.dndbeyond.com/senses/2-tooltip?disable-webm=1&amp;amp;disable-webm=1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(17, 136, 76) !important; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold !important; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;darkvision&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;to see.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4 id=&quot;CroakerCaveFrigidPools&quot; class=&quot;compendium-hr heading-anchor&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;59d995dc-25ce-4b29-b43f-2b29d3edf57e&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 19.5px 0px 6.5px; font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; scroll-margin-top: 16px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/egtw/adventures-in-wildemount-frozen-sick#CroakerCaveFrigidPools&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;8a0e78b4-2f84-48fc-8c02-901ca1594111&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(0, 106, 190); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Frigid Pools&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p data-content-chunk-id=&quot;902890a1-231d-415c-ae13-ccd7dcce1a1a&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px; width: 850px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Pools of murky, frigid water within the caverns are created by melting snow on the rocky ground above dripping down through the ceiling. Each pool is 10 feet deep. A creature completely submerged in a pool must succeed on a DC 10 Constitution saving throw or gain one level of&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;tooltip-hover condition-tooltip&quot; href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/free-rules/rules-glossary#ExhaustionCondition&quot; data-tooltip-href=&quot;//www.dndbeyond.com/conditions/4-tooltip?disable-webm=1&amp;amp;disable-webm=1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(17, 136, 76) !important; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold !important; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;exhaustion&lt;/a&gt;. Creatures with resistance or immunity to cold damage automatically succeed on this saving throw. For each minute the creature spends submerged in a pool, it must repeat this saving throw, gaining another level of&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;tooltip-hover condition-tooltip&quot; href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/free-rules/rules-glossary#ExhaustionCondition&quot; data-tooltip-href=&quot;//www.dndbeyond.com/conditions/4-tooltip?disable-webm=1&amp;amp;disable-webm=1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(17, 136, 76) !important; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold !important; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;exhaustion&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;on a failure.&lt;/p&gt;" link="&lt;p data-content-chunk-id=&quot;75c5a31e-1a0d-4900-933c-650edfdb6dbb&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px; width: 850px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;The caverns and tunnels of the Croaker Cave complex are shown on map 5.9. Unless otherwise noted in an area’s description, the following features are common throughout all areas of Croaker Cave.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4 id=&quot;CroakerCaveCeilings&quot; class=&quot;compendium-hr heading-anchor&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;8a057feb-a1b1-4c15-be82-afde0fff6e60&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 19.5px 0px 6.5px; font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; scroll-margin-top: 16px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/egtw/adventures-in-wildemo